<mjml>
    <mj-head>
        <mj-title>EdgeCDN-X Newsletter - November 2026</mj-title>
        <mj-preview>EdgeCDN-X DNS is live at portal.edgecdnx.com, with a free plan to try.</mj-preview>
        <mj-attributes>
            <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
            <mj-text color="#353333" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" />
            <mj-button background-color="#3472ed" color="#ffffff" border-radius="5px" />
        </mj-attributes>
    </mj-head>

    <mj-body background-color="#f4f6fb">
        <mj-section background-color="#3472ed" padding="10px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-image
                    src="https://edgecdnx.fra1.digitaloceanspaces.com/assets/public/Logo%20Transparency%20white.png"
                    alt="EdgeCDN-X" width="250px" align="center" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding="10px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-text>
                    <h2 style="color: #1E90FF; margin-top: 0;">November 2026 Newsletter</h2>
                    <p><b>Hello everyone,</b></p>
                    <p>
                        EdgeCDN-X DNS has moved into production. You can now try the hosted service at
                        <a href="https://portal.edgecdnx.com/@TrackLink">portal.edgecdnx.com</a>, with a free plan
                        available to get started.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        EdgeCDN-X helps teams manage DNS and routing in a Kubernetes-native platform.
                        Configure straightforward DNS answers or use policies such as weighted routing,
                        failover, geolocation, and round-robin. Health checks and location state help
                        determine which nodes are eligible to receive traffic.
                    </p>
                </mj-text>

                <mj-text>
                    <h4 style="color: #1E90FF;">EdgeCDN-X DNS is now in production</h4>
                    <p>
                        The production portal provides access to the hosted EdgeCDN-X DNS service, without
                        requiring you to deploy the platform yourself. Start with the free Starter tier
                        and explore the service before choosing a paid plan.
                    </p>
                </mj-text>
                <mj-button
                    href="https://portal.edgecdnx.com/@TrackLink"
                    target="_blank"
                    padding="10px 0 24px">
                    Try the free plan
                </mj-button>

                <mj-text>
                    <h4 style="color: #1E90FF;">Simple options as your needs grow</h4>
                    <p>
                        The pricing page lists Starter at €0 per month, Business at €6 per month, and
                        Enterprise at €30 per month. Starter is described as including all advanced
                        features; Business is a higher usage tier, while Enterprise is suited to hosting
                        and platform-as-a-service (PaaS) solutions. You can switch the displayed currency
                        between euros and US dollars on the pricing page.
                    </p>
                </mj-text>
                <mj-button
                    href="https://edgecdnx.com/pricing@TrackLink"
                    target="_blank"
                    padding="10px 0 24px">
                    View plans and pricing
                </mj-button>

                <mj-text>
                    <h4 style="color: #1E90FF;">Explore DNS routing</h4>
                    <p>
                        See how EdgeCDN-X uses DNS routing policies to direct requests to suitable edge
                        locations, or read the documentation to learn about running the open-source
                        components yourself.
                    </p>
                </mj-text>
                <mj-button
                    href="https://edgecdn-x.github.io/@TrackLink"
                    target="_blank"
                    padding="10px 0 24px">
                    Read the documentation
                </mj-button>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section background-color="#353333" padding="20px">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-social mode="horizontal" icon-size="24px" align="center">
                    <mj-social-element name="youtube" href="https://www.youtube.com/@edgecdnx@TrackLink"
                        background-color="#01b1ff" />
                    <mj-social-element name="x" href="https://x.com/EdgecdnX@TrackLink" background-color="#01b1ff" />
                    <mj-social-element name="github" href="https://github.com/EdgeCDN-X@TrackLink"
                        background-color="#01b1ff" />
                </mj-social>

                <mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" color="#ffffff">
                    2026 TboTech s.r.o. - EdgeCDN-X<br></br>Slovakia
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section background-color="#ffffff">
            <mj-column>
                <mj-raw>
                    <div class="footer" style="text-align: center;font-size: 12px;color: #888;">
                        <p>
                            <a href="{{ UnsubscribeURL }}" style="color: #888;">Unsubscribe</a>
                            &#160;&#160;
                            <a href="{{ MessageURL }}" style="color: #888;">View in browser</a>
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="gutter" style="padding: 30px;">&#160;{{ TrackView }}</div>
                </mj-raw>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>
    </mj-body>
</mjml>
